# The @rebels-ecom scope is published to and installed from GitHub Packages.
# Authentication is intentionally NOT committed here:
#   CI:    actions/setup-node (registry-url + scope) writes the auth line from secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN
#   Local/consumer: supply a token via your own ~/.npmrc or NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (see README → Installation)
@rebels-ecom:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
